                "**Pipeline Processing Summary:**\n",
                "- **Bronze Layer**: 14,000 raw records ingested from 2 source tables\n",
                "- **Silver Layer**: 10,010 records dropped by validation constraints (invalid ratings, missing dates, invalid vote counts)\n",
                "- **Gold Layer**: **1,987 high-quality movies** ready for analytics (71% data quality rate)\n",
                "\n",
                "**Quality Controls Applied:**\n",
                "- Vote average validation (0-10 range)\n",
                "- Vote count validation (>= 0)\n",
                "- Release date completeness checks\n",
                "- Data quality flags tracked throughout\n",
                "\n",
                "**Governance Standards:**\n",
                "✓ Full column documentation\n",
                "✓ Audit timestamps on all tables\n",
                "✓ Delta Change Data Feed enabled\n",
                "✓ Source system lineage tracked"
